      8 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اعتراهُ</span></b> : see 1, in six places. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also <i>i. q.</i>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَصَدَ عَرَاهُ</span> i. e. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَاحِيَتَهُ</span> [app. as meaning <i>He repaired to his region,</i> or <i>quarter;</i> or <i>his vicinage</i>].
(TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And <i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَبَلَهُ</span> [<i>He,</i> or <i>it, rendered him
possessed,</i> or <i>insane;</i> or <i>unsound in his intellect,</i> or
<i>in a limb</i> or <i>member</i>]. (TA.)

